label "Blackboard shared state diagram"
canvas 460 270
box bb 160 100 140 66 "blackboard|shared state" acc
box s1 20 24 96 34 "specialist"
box s2 344 24 96 34 "specialist"
box s3 20 200 96 34 "specialist"
box s4 344 200 96 34 "specialist"
box ctl 160 14 140 42 "control|picks who runs next"
arrow s1 bb both
arrow s2 bb both
arrow s3 bb both
arrow s4 bb both
arrow bb ctl dashed
text 236 83 "reads" size=10 left
note "no specialist-to-specialist edges — everything goes through the shared state"
